# Auto push after work

After finishing requested code or UI changes, commit the relevant files and `git push origin HEAD` to `main` so Vercel deploys. Do not wait for a separate "deploy" or "push" prompt.

- Use a short commit message in this repo's existing style (why, not a file dump).
- Never commit `.env.local`, secrets, `.vscode/`, or unrelated local files.
- Skip commit/push when the prompt was only a question or there is nothing to commit.
- Do not force-push or skip git hooks.
